"、\\ `6fe99051c <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/6fe99051c>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.8.0.rst:208
msgid "``csi`` is new — its API is not yet frozen *(minor)*"
msgstr "``csi`` 是新模块 —— 其 API 尚未冻结 *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.8.0.rst:210
msgid ""
"The :mod:`csi` module is introduced in v4.8.0 and its API evolved during the"
" release: ``csi.fb()`` was removed, and :meth:`csi.CSI.snapshot` "
"``(image=...)`` now requires a *mutable* image and draws/scales the captured"
" frame into it instead of doing a raw deep copy. Early adopters of the new "
"module should re-test; the legacy ``sensor`` API is unaffected."
msgstr ""
":mod:`csi` 模块在 v4.8.0 中引入，其 API 在本次发布过程中有所演进：\\ ``csi.fb()`` 已被移除，\\ "
":meth:`csi.CSI.snapshot` 的 ``(image=...)`` 现在要求传入一个\\ *可变的*\\ "
"图像，并将捕获的帧绘制/缩放到该图像中，而不再执行原始的深拷贝。新模块的早期使用者应重新测试；旧版 ``sensor`` API 不受影响。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.8.0.rst:216
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `0bc0385eb "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/0bc0385eb>`__, `8cd7a309f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/8cd7a309f>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `0bc0385eb <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/0bc0385eb>`__\\ "
"、\\ `8cd7a309f <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/8cd7a309f>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.8.0.rst:222
msgid "``image.ImageIO`` stream mode and ``close()`` *(minor)*"
msgstr "``image.ImageIO`` 流模式与 ``close()`` *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.8.0.rst:224
msgid ""
":class:`image.ImageIO` — the ``mode`` argument now accepts only lowercase "
"``'r'`` / ``'w'`` (uppercase is rejected with an updated error message), and"
" opening with ``'w'`` always truncates/recreates the file instead of "
"preserving an existing stream. ``ImageIO.close()`` is now idempotent "
"(closing an already-closed stream no longer raises) and returns ``None`` "
"instead of the stream object."
msgstr ""
":class:`image.ImageIO` —— ``mode`` 参数现在仅接受小写的 ``'r'`` / ``'w'``\\ "
"（大写会被拒绝并给出更新后的错误消息），且以 ``'w'`` 打开总是截断/重建文件，而不再保留现有的流。\\ ``ImageIO.close()`` "
"现在是幂等的（关闭一个已关闭的流不再引发异常），并返回 ``None`` 而非流对象。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.8.0.rst:231
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `715c4cbba "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/715c4cbba>`__, `21ceec422 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/21ceec422>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `715c4cbba <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/715c4cbba>`__\\ "
"、\\ `21ceec422 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/21ceec422>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.8.0.rst:237
msgid "BlazeFace / BlazePalm return value *(minor)*"
msgstr "BlazeFace / BlazePalm 的返回值 *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.8.0.rst:239
msgid ""
"The :class:`~ml.postprocessing.mediapipe.BlazeFace` and "
":class:`~ml.postprocessing.mediapipe.BlazePalm` post-processors (new in this"
" release) now return a single bounding-box list instead of the full per-"
"class list — callers index the result directly rather than ``[0]``."
msgstr ""
":class:`~ml.postprocessing.mediapipe.BlazeFace` 和 "
":class:`~ml.postprocessing.mediapipe.BlazePalm` "
"后处理器（本版本新增）现在返回单个边界框列表，而非完整的按类列表 —— 调用者可直接索引结果，而无需使用 ``[0]``\\ 。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.8.0.rst:244
msgid ""
"*Commit:* `75e16b573 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/75e16b573>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `75e16b573 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/75e16b573>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.8.0.rst:249
msgid "ML post-processor callback receives raw tensors *(behavior)*"
msgstr "ML 后处理器回调接收原始张量 *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.8.0.rst:251
msgid ""
"A :class:`ml.Model` ``predict()`` post-process callback now receives the raw"
" (quantized) output-tensor references instead of pre-converted float "
"``ndarray``\\ s — this avoids memory exhaustion on large models. If no "
"callback is supplied, the float ``ndarray`` is still returned. Custom "
"callbacks must dequantize the tensors themselves (the built-in post-"
"processors already do)."
msgstr ""
":class:`ml.Model` 的 ``predict()`` 后处理回调现在接收原始（量化的）输出张量引用，而非预先转换的浮点 "
"``ndarray`` —— 这避免了在大型模型上耗尽内存。如果未提供回调，仍会返回浮点 ``ndarray``\\ "
"。自定义回调必须自行对张量进行反量化（内置的后处理器已经这样做了）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.8.0.rst:257
msgid ""
"*Commit:* `84e6ee650 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/84e6ee650>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `84e6ee650 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/84e6ee650>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.8.0.rst:262
msgid "Camera clock decoupled from CSI state *(behavior)*"
msgstr "摄像头时钟已与 CSI 状态解耦 *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.8.0.rst:264
msgid ""
"The sensor clock is now independent of CSI state. ``set_clock`` / "
"``set_frequency`` only reconfigures the clock when the requested frequency "
"differs by more than a tolerance, and ``get_clk_frequency`` takes a boolean "
"to return the exact (rather than nominal) frequency. The default clock is 24"
" MHz on the OpenMV N6 and AE3, so no explicit ``set_clock()`` is needed at "
"boot. Scripts that toggled the clock for timing-sensitive captures should "
"re-check their assumptions."
msgstr ""
"传感器时钟现在独立于 CSI 状态。\\ ``set_clock`` / ``set_frequency`` "
"仅在请求的频率与当前频率相差超过容差时才重新配置时钟，而 ``get_clk_frequency`` "
"接受一个布尔值以返回精确（而非标称）频率。OpenMV N6 和 AE3 上的默认时钟为 24 MHz，因此启动时无需显式调用 "
"``set_clock()``\\ 。为时序敏感的捕获而切换时钟的脚本应重新检查其假设。"

