msgstr "迁移清单"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.8.0.rst:300
msgid "For a clean port to v4.8.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "要顺利移植到 v4.8.0，通常需要做的工作是："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.8.0.rst:302
msgid ""
"If you used the FLIR Lepton through :mod:`fir`, switch to capturing it as a "
"camera sensor (:ref:`the fir/Lepton change <v4_8_0_fir>`)."
msgstr ""
"如果你通过 :mod:`fir` 使用 FLIR Lepton，请改为将其作为摄像头传感器来捕获（\\ :ref:`fir/Lepton 变更 "
"<v4_8_0_fir>`\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.8.0.rst:304
msgid ""
"Replace any ``buzzer`` use with :class:`machine.PWM` (:ref:`the buzzer "
"removal <v4_8_0_buzzer>`)."
msgstr ""
"用 :class:`machine.PWM` 替换任何 ``buzzer`` 的使用（\\ :ref:`buzzer 移除 "
"<v4_8_0_buzzer>`\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.8.0.rst:306
msgid ""
"Remove ``omv.disable_fb()`` calls (:ref:`the omv.disable_fb() removal "
"<v4_8_0_omv_fb>`)."
msgstr ""
"移除 ``omv.disable_fb()`` 调用（\\ :ref:`omv.disable_fb() 移除 <v4_8_0_omv_fb>`\\ "
"）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.8.0.rst:308
msgid ""
"For :class:`image.ImageIO`: use lowercase ``'r'``/``'w'`` and expect ``'w'``"
" to truncate (:ref:`the ImageIO change <v4_8_0_imageio>`)."
msgstr ""
